# CWebView runtime OpenSSL configuration.
#
# The VitaSDK OpenSSL port can otherwise retain the build-time OPENSSLDIR
# (for example /usr/local/vitasdk/arm-vita-eabi/ssl). CWebView sets
# OPENSSL_CONF to this application-local file before libcurl initializes.
# Keep this intentionally minimal so OpenSSL uses its built-in defaults.
